*.json
!deploy/**/*.json
!codecov.yml
!/_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/release-issue-snapshot.json
# Sanitized real S3/IAM release rehearsal report; verified by
# scripts/check-real-s3-iam-gate.sh on a PASS evidence state (must follow *.json).
!/artifacts/production-rehearsal/report.json

# Logs
